      "comment": "LEYTON (1) is suited by the inside draw. Latest effort finished 4th in a Restricted WIN on August 21 over 498m at this track behind Rio Ragnar beaten 12 lengths (29.25). Suited here and can find winning form. INFRASONIC (3) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Major Swing (22.02) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading player again. DONE BY NOON (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.12) at this track behind Thunderlash in a P5. Has the pace to be prominent. Will give a great sight again. OPTIONAL (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
